create website using html css and js about the importance of water in life                                                                                                          
     + Thought: 278ms                                                                                     
                                                                                                          
     Created water.html — a single-page website about the importance of water. Here's what it includes:   
                                                                                                          
     Sections:                                                                                            
                                                                                                          
     - Hero — animated water droplet with gradient background and wave SVG                                
     - Stats — animated counters (71% Earth covered, 60% body water, etc.)                                
     - Benefits — 6 cards covering brain, heart, muscles, digestion, temperature, and ecosystems          
     - Did You Know — auto-advancing fact carousel with 10 fascinating facts                              
     - Daily Water Footprint — animated bar chart showing water cost of beef, coffee, phones, etc.        
     - Save Water Tips — 6 practical water-saving suggestions                                             
     - Pledge — interactive counter persisted in localStorage                                             
                                                                                                          
     Features:                                                                                            
                                                                                                          
     - Sticky navigation on scroll                                                                        
     - Scroll-triggered animations (IntersectionObserver)                                                 
     - Counter animations, animated progress bars                                                         
     - Responsive design (works on mobile)                                                                
     - Zero external dependencies — single HTML file                                                      
                                                                                                          
